           <div type="translation" source="bib:Jacques2011_01">
                <p>In 1128 <foreign>śaka</foreign>, noble donation from Vraḥ Pāda Monseigneur Śrī Jayavarmadeva to the god Śrī Trilokanātha, of the holy village <supplied reason="subaudible">called</supplied> Śrī Rājapatīśvaragrāma.</p>
